  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Gulpur Hydropower plant is one of several World Bank-funded projects located in Pakistan and is part of the Pakistan Government&#x2019;s least-cost energy generation plan. The plant is being developed by Mira Power, a subsidiary of Korean company KOSEP, and lies on the Poonch River about 170km from Islamabad.</narrative>
  </description>
