   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our investment will support the construction of Gulpur Hydropower Plant, a new 102 megawatt (MW) hydro power plant with annual generation capability of 465 GWh. The Asian Development Bank (ADB) is providing the loan to Mira Power. The facility will help tackle Pakistan&#xED;s dire power shortage.</narrative>
   </description>
